  "veilFinding": {
    "cause": "Phaser TimeStep.smoothDelta clamps raw elapsed time to the 16.7ms target during its 120-frame startup cooldown (and while unfocused). At 10fps that cooldown lasts 12 wall seconds; movement and caption clocks receive less time. No caption-owned cutscene flag, input clear, held reset, kit lock or scene.paused was found.",
    "fix": "Stage 7 temporarily sets loop.smoothStep=false and restores it on cleanup. Existing bounded scene catch-up consumes full delta. Veil has a scene-owned 1.2s expiry as well as the HUD expiry.",
